---@field name? string Initial referring domain.
---@field visitors? number Unique visitors from this source.
---@field change? posthog.web_analytics.WoWChange|distilled.Null Period-over-period change in visitors, null when not meaningful.

---@class posthog.web_analytics.UpdateAeoBrandsPartialRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string
---@field name? string Brand name as people say it.
---@field kind? posthog.web_analytics.BrandKindEnum|string What the brand is to the project: 'own', 'competitor', 'publisher' or 'unknown'. * `own` - Own * `competitor` - Competitor * `publisher` - Publisher * `unknown` - Unknown
---@field status? posthog.web_analytics.BrandStatusEnum|string 'confirmed' to accept the brand, 'ignored' to hide it, 'suggested' to put it back for review. * `suggested` - Suggested * `confirmed` - Confirmed * `ignored` - Ignored
---@field aliases? posthog.web_analytics.UpdateAeoBrandsPartialRequestAliasesList Replaces the brand's other names. Names are trimmed, and repeated names are dropped.

---Replaces the brand's other names. Names are trimmed, and repeated names are dropped.
---@alias posthog.web_analytics.UpdateAeoBrandsPartialRequestAliasesList string[]

---@class posthog.web_analytics.UpdateAeoPromptsPartialRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string
---@field active? boolean|distilled.Null Turn the prompt on or off for future runs.
---@field topic? string New topic for the prompt. An empty string removes the topic. Past checks keep the topic they ran with.
---@field prompt? string New text for the prompt. A change adds the next version and makes it current; the prompt keeps its id and its check history, and each check records the version that ran. A change of case or whitespace only adds no version. Fails with 409 when another prompt in the set already has the text.
---@field version_description? string Optional note on what the text change does, stored on the new version. Send it with 'prompt'.
---@field current_version? number|distilled.Null Make an existing version current again, for example to roll back a text change. Adds no version. Fails with 400 when the version does not exist, and with 409 when another prompt has its text.
---@field archived? boolean|distilled.Null True archives the prompt: it is turned off, never runs again, and keeps its check history. Send it without other fields. False restores an archived prompt. A restored prompt stays off unless 'active' is true in the same request. An archived prompt accepts no other change until it is restored.

