---Import AEO prompts
---
---Adds prompts to the project's AEO prompt set, or updates the topic and visibility of prompts that already exist. Existing prompts keep their active state. Prompts whose text matches an archived prompt are skipped.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/bulk_import/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsBulkImportRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.AEOPromptImportResult? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_bulk_import(input) end

---List an AEO prompt's checks
---
---Lists every check of one prompt, newest first, one page at a time. Filter by engine, by prompt version, or with since to see only checks from a point in time on. Each check has the engine's answer, the URLs it cited, the searches it ran and the prompt version it ran. Set include_answer_text=false to leave the answers out and page through history with smaller responses.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/{id}/checks/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsChecksRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.PaginatedAEOPromptCheckList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_checks(input) end

---Archive an AEO prompt
---
---Archives a prompt: it is turned off and never runs again. Nothing is deleted, and its versions and checks are kept. Restore it with a PATCH of archived=false.
---
---`DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/{id}/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsDestroyRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsDestroyResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_destroy(input) end

---Get the AEO prompt set overview
---
---Gets an overview of the project's whole AEO prompt set for the last 'days' days (default 30) in the project's timezone: how many prompts are tracked, how many checks ran, the citation rate and the brand-mention rate, the same counts for the window before it, the current window split per answer engine (Claude, ChatGPT/OpenAI, Exa) and per topic, and the domains the engines cited most.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/overview/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsOverviewRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.AEOPromptSetOverview? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_overview(input) end

---Get an AEO prompt's citation stats
---
---Gets citation and brand-mention totals per answer engine for one prompt, plus, for the last 30 days in the project's timezone, per-day counts, which engines cite which domains, brand sentiment per engine, and the words of the web searches the engines ran.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/{id}/stats/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsStatsRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.AEOPromptStats? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_stats(input) end

---Suggest AEO prompts
---
---Suggests prompts to track for a site. Requires AI data processing approved for the organization. Claude reads the site with web search and writes questions a buyer would ask an AI assistant, each labeled with a topic, a circle, a funnel stage and whether it names the brand. Nothing is saved: import the prompts you keep with bulk_import. Prompts the project already tracks are left out. Returns a pending job right away; poll GET aeo_prompts/suggest/<id>/ until it completes, which takes up to a few minutes.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/suggest/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsSuggestRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics.AeoPromptsSuggestResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:aeo_prompts_suggest(input) end

---List AEO prompt topics
---
---Lists the topics in the project's AEO prompt set, with the number of prompts in each.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/aeo_prompts/topics/`
